# Contact

Want to learn Chinese with Allen? Send an email and include these three lines. That is enough to start — no form, no account needed.

**Email: [spritenee@gmail.com](mailto:spritenee@gmail.com)**

Please include:

1. **Your level** — complete beginner, can say a few sentences, can read some characters, or intermediate?
2. **Why you are learning Chinese** — travel, work, family, heritage, interest in Chinese culture, or something else?
3. **How you found this site** — search, YouTube, a friend, or somewhere else?

You can also find Allen here:

- YouTube: https://youtube.com/spritenee
- Facebook: https://facebook.com/spritenee
- X: https://twitter.com/spritenee

> Teaching format, schedule, and pricing will be confirmed by email after the first contact, once Allen knows your level and goal. Nothing on this page promises a specific course, price, or result.
